      "content": "i cant even look at the news anymore without feeling like im just watching a slow motion car crash. everyone is acting like things are normal but they arent. the planet is literally dying and there is nothing anyone can do to stop it. it feels so pointless to even try to plan a future or do anything when it feels like we're just waiting for the end.",
